  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MICCA II: Support to the Spanish Authorities in the Implementation of Circular Migration Programs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the aim of supporting the Spanish Directorate General for Migration in the implementation of labour mobility schemes, the second phase of the MICCA project aims at strenghtening IOMs intervention in four differente phases of information provision aimed at the migrant workers recruited under the national GECCO program: Pre-employment Orientation (PEO), Pre-Departure Orienattion (PDO), Post-Arival Orientation (PAO) and Pre-Return Orientation (PRO).</narrative>
  </description>
